1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,290
Picking hundreds over twenties here is a two hundred grand fuck-up.

2
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:07,985
Here's the game. Some rich weirdo offers you free cash, two ways.

3
00:00:09,185 --> 00:00:12,102
Option one, you get your body weight in twenty dollar bills.

4
00:00:12,802 --> 00:00:15,556
Option two, you get hundreds stacked flat, as tall as you.

5
00:00:16,356 --> 00:00:18,497
Double-tap if your brain yelled hundreds.

6
00:00:19,197 --> 00:00:22,443
But a bill is thin as hell, and every bill weighs about one gram.

7
00:00:23,243 --> 00:00:25,840
So a pound of twenties is only about nine grand.

8
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:29,286
And one inch of hundreds is about twenty-three grand.

9
00:00:30,186 --> 00:00:34,367
Sounds like the inch wins, right? Except you've got way more damn pounds than inches.

10
00:00:35,067 --> 00:00:37,192
Send this to whoever'd grab the hundreds.

11
00:00:37,892 --> 00:00:41,460
The CDC says the average American dude weighs one ninety-nine.

12
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:44,534
And he's about five foot nine.

13
00:00:45,234 --> 00:00:48,410
His height in hundreds is about one point six million dollars.

14
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:52,273
Now follow the math, because his weight is where it gets stupid.

15
00:00:52,973 --> 00:00:55,767
His weight in twenties is about one point eight million.

16
00:00:58,117 --> 00:01:01,247
So the damn scale pays two hundred grand more than the tape measure.

17
00:01:02,147 --> 00:01:05,087
So what's it gonna be, twenties, or the two hundred grand fuck-up?
